          fr(
            'Afarer manufactures touring SUP boards for global brands, expedition outfitters, and retail chains. Our drop-stitch production lines produce CE-certified touring boards with custom length options, deck graphics, and packaging. MOQ from 50 units. Lead times from 30 days.',
